    <briefdescription>
<para>Decides whether a URL may be scraped. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A URL is allowed when:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>The whitelist is empty OR the URL starts with at least one whitelist entry (prefix match) or matches a glob pattern (*) AND</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>The URL does NOT start with any blacklist entry and does not match any blacklist glob pattern.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para>Scheme must be http or https; any other scheme is rejected regardless of the whitelist to prevent SSRF. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
